[I] SIXEL encoder/decoder implementation

[T] libsixel provides a C encoder/decoder implementation for DEC SIXEL
[T] graphics, a terminal-friendly escape sequence image format introduced by
[T] Digital Equipment Corp. It also includes the img2sixel and sixel2png
[T] converter programs; this is a maintained fork with security fixes.

[U] https://github.com/libsixel/libsixel

[A] Libsixel Authors
